KX1sDmRcGC6fSzdnQbxU8hs-TNr1t9k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwTM01Bl0KPRcLbnFQpo8q9_vzQQZIdnvlEySlb8ounQA&oe=69D116B2"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot(1)_2560_1440.png", "id": "2100665936973153", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982680_2100665940306486_5664456920141678252_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=485X1uh3vKEQ7kNvwGIfA3b&_nc_oc=Adodf55kdE5Shzto2ZYQb_B01TroFzfPWHRj2OKTjsDSJHDUva-JDk-vlSG-6ykTmLE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfzU2MhW3xs3KzToeXOCku5EPFFXGfOQjQ7ytpIJ-5ggOg&oe=69D103D7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Image.png", "id": "368600119311127", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_368600122644460_5598028405797075028_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nDi7K2d8zjkQ7kNvwEP-6Pu&_nc_oc=AdqFoRTy9Eon4_gc4avRsiO0v0Xq-QanuoW0AWfOCvo0tbggvyAd3hPZ06Zeo5wOBsI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afz_l9KWLdoEGNgSbjMrO2L_ydySfDFVwTXrVq_ztP7EMQ&oe=69D10915"}, "display_name": "2035 Carbon neutrality of smart green city", "keywords": [], "long_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths.\n\n1. Experience goal\n- Discover specific career topics in promising future industries and occupations against the backdrop of a smart green city in 2035\n- Explore a future path by experiencing a space for carbon neutrality\n- Learn about the need for carbon neutrality and what young people can do\n- Learn about core underlying technologies such as realistic content technology provided as an experience\n\n2. Characteristics of content\n- First-person perspective in which the experiencer becomes the main character\n- 7-step composition according to the actual experience process\n- Developed based on standing only\n- Movement and manipulation using the Oculus Controller\n- Estimated experience time of about 20 to 30 minutes\n\n3. 7-step configuration\nSTEP 1 Instructions on how to operate\nSTEP 2 Meeting with the UN Youth Delegation\nSTEP 3 Practicing carbon neutrality in urban forests\nSTEP 4 Implementation of carbon neutrality in wind power plants\nSTEP 5 Carbon neutrality practice at the East Coast carbon storage site\nSTEP 6 Think\nSTEP 7 Finishing\n", "short_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HeroCover_3000x900.png", "id": "7527653000591853", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_7527653007258519_8435369833685824333_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=L1h0VV3XDasQ7kNvwEz2-Po&_nc_oc=AdrZ5wHQ0O5_4xsGO5n-YKAeJDMVddZ5-9mvUZYO2nGVwtf2qsCGyKUjv8NDjFbOvVM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afxl0G0HuS2lTYncX2G_hos4Kr3T-NIhz4sma1ZarkttcQ&oe=69D11CC2"}, {"file_name": "Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1452940842279363", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031355_1452940845612696_1891464877969558457_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xKkptCju-5oQ7kNvwHTuw4y&_nc_oc=AdpzOVB1hqnd1j_bojGYfrHcw6O5ei_VZHrIhIeaH7RtxkON3WH2zu_Fx0rNiOPsyWY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afx3DkIIzS-8gGHxOFPaElDIyFuWZ_-2wFAsYWm7sCM-DA&oe=69D10344"}, {"file_name": "Portrait_1008x1440.png", "id": "959181839136200", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566686_959181842469533_2388841801262298119_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PadYTiVSvJ4Q7kNvwE360uI&_nc_oc=AdoLn5Yk6FRRhf1In-OCWvEmCE4lQvhPnbShaliKcKsWTcNFyE_5hH8F8Zh1WLP